        "recommendation": "The combobox is a `div` with `tabIndex={0}` and focus never leaves it while the list is open, so the highlighted option is shown to sighted keyboard users only through the `option--active` class. No stylesheet in the change or the repository defines `.size-picker` or `.option--active`. Check that the stylesheet loaded on the product page gives the combobox a visible focus indicator (WCAG 2.4.7 Focus Visible) and the active option a highlight that meets 3:1 against its neighbours (WCAG 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast); without them, a keyboard user pressing ArrowDown cannot see which size Enter will pick.",
